WEBVTT

00:00:00.726 --> 00:00:04.389
I could hear you without raising
your voice like that.

00:00:06.665 --> 00:00:08.929
Every time I see you, you're all cuts and bruises.

00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:14.262
You two-faced brat.

00:00:18.811 --> 00:00:19.745
Hey!

00:00:19.745 --> 00:00:22.305
< Mafuyu? Is it really you, Mafuyu? >

00:00:22.748 --> 00:00:23.942
< What of their shape? >

00:00:24.583 --> 00:00:25.743
< Their weight? >

00:00:27.186 --> 00:00:29.521
Idiot!

00:00:29.521 --> 00:00:33.592
< There's no way Mafuyu's breasts
could be this big. >

00:00:33.592 --> 00:00:34.860
< Is this an illusion? >

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:37.829
< With my back up against the wall,
now I'm seeing illusions? >

00:00:39.798 --> 00:00:40.699
Excellent.

00:00:40.699 --> 00:00:41.996
Stop it!

00:00:42.468 --> 00:00:43.457
Excellent!

00:00:44.603 --> 00:00:46.070
Excellent, excellent!

00:00:47.973 --> 00:00:50.407
< Is this a dream? An illusion? >

00:00:52.311 --> 00:00:54.779
I told you to stop!

00:00:55.948 --> 00:00:57.883
I'm real, and so are my breasts!

00:00:57.883 --> 00:00:59.385
I've nurtured them!

00:00:59.385 --> 00:01:00.352
"Nurtured"?

00:01:00.552 --> 00:01:04.818
Girls change if you take your eyes
off them, even for a little bit.

00:01:08.660 --> 00:01:10.562
No, you haven't changed.

00:01:10.562 --> 00:01:11.663
What?!

00:01:11.663 --> 00:01:14.632
You're... Mafuyu!

00:01:20.372 --> 00:01:30.916
Trance, nureta tsumi ga yobu shoudou

00:01:30.916 --> 00:01:35.114
Modokashii aserasareta kodou

00:01:36.088 --> 00:01:39.888
Kimi wa aizu mo mushi datta

00:01:41.326 --> 00:01:46.127
Dandan to ronri ga kuruu to shittete

00:01:46.532 --> 00:01:50.901
Nerau inochi ga moeru

00:01:51.437 --> 00:01:56.608
Isshu no kairaku, itai yo, mune

00:01:56.608 --> 00:02:00.913
Afuresou na seihai

00:02:00.913 --> 00:02:07.419
Shizumare, suberu made wa osaete

00:02:07.419 --> 00:02:14.393
Subete te ni iretai to kimeta, Lilith yo

00:02:14.393 --> 00:02:16.862
Harisakesou, imademo

00:02:16.862 --> 00:02:20.466
Watashi o dakishimete

00:02:20.466 --> 00:02:24.770
Kurushimeru imi o misete

00:02:24.770 --> 00:02:30.709
Owarasero, saigo wa kokoro no kakera sae

00:02:30.709 --> 00:02:35.914
Kimi ga motomeru kyouchi ni wa todokisou ni nai

00:02:35.914 --> 00:02:38.484
I, I, I

00:02:38.484 --> 00:02:41.385
I'm in spiral

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:44.887
Qwaser of Stigmata II

00:02:46.859 --> 00:02:50.260
Reunion

00:02:51.096 --> 00:02:55.396
Mafuyu Oribe. So, YOU were the trump card?

00:02:56.435 --> 00:02:57.561
It's a miracle.

00:02:58.470 --> 00:03:01.098
That's Tsubasa and Miyuki, right?

00:03:01.406 --> 00:03:02.566
Yes.

00:03:06.745 --> 00:03:08.576
The iron user's Maria.

00:03:09.414 --> 00:03:11.814
You've arrived far too late!

00:03:20.192 --> 00:03:21.386
Die!

00:03:25.998 --> 00:03:32.233
It wasn't long after Sasha disappeared from St.
Mihailov Academy that I learned the fearful truth:

00:03:33.172 --> 00:03:37.268
The Maria of the Blade inside me
was far from dormant.

00:03:38.010 --> 00:03:42.242
At first, I thought I was just a little ill,
but that wasn't it.

00:03:42.614 --> 00:03:48.177
The power of the reactivated circuit began
producing soma inside me again...

00:03:48.353 --> 00:03:53.347
And what Athos's messenger
had to tell me was hard to hear.

00:03:55.627 --> 00:04:01.827
The circuit had bonded to me at the
molecular level and couldn't be removed.

00:04:06.171 --> 00:04:08.469
There was only one option left:

00:04:08.740 --> 00:04:14.610
I had to become an Operator, capable of
completely controlling the Maria of the Blade.

00:04:17.883 --> 00:04:18.850
Katja!

00:04:19.384 --> 00:04:21.215
Call me "My Queen."

00:04:22.888 --> 00:04:26.984
I temporarily became Katja's Maria,
and underwent training.

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:27.826
Swabia, Germany - Weintzern

00:04:27.826 --> 00:04:33.031
At first I cursed my situation,
but soon I thought of it this way:

00:04:34.566 --> 00:04:38.866
Now I'd be able to fight alongside you, Sasha.

00:04:39.338 --> 00:04:41.533
I didn't have to wait around anymore.

00:04:46.044 --> 00:04:47.136
Huh?!

00:04:47.246 --> 00:04:49.881
So you and Oribe went on vacation?

00:04:49.881 --> 00:04:51.678
It was training.

00:04:52.451 --> 00:04:55.954
While I was slogging it out
with that two-faced brat,

00:04:55.954 --> 00:04:58.821
I never thought you'd be doing THIS and THAT!

00:04:59.391 --> 00:05:00.626
Who can say?

00:05:00.626 --> 00:05:03.686
How perverted! And yet cute, Miss Katja!

00:05:04.029 --> 00:05:05.326
Rest easy.

00:05:05.631 --> 00:05:09.089
That girl didn't have what it takes to be a slave.

00:05:10.869 --> 00:05:13.770
Still, she's not unworthy of praise.

00:05:14.606 --> 00:05:17.871
She was able to endure my HARD training.

00:05:20.312 --> 00:05:21.904
It was so much fun.

00:05:23.815 --> 00:05:27.546
Um, Sister? Who is Mafuyu Oribe?

00:05:27.619 --> 00:05:32.852
Yeah. She's important,
but that idiot went and neglected her.

00:05:33.925 --> 00:05:35.017
She's his guardian.

00:05:39.931 --> 00:05:42.900
Look what's happened to you. You fool!

00:05:50.442 --> 00:05:51.704
So they've scattered.

00:05:52.778 --> 00:05:55.269
Those foolish heretics.

00:06:07.426 --> 00:06:09.995
You can still move, Miyuki Seta?

00:06:09.995 --> 00:06:13.897
With your mask now gone, you look so weak.

00:06:14.299 --> 00:06:19.931
I... I just want to be with Tsubasa!

00:06:20.138 --> 00:06:25.405
A trifle. Tsubasa Amano has become
the cornerstone of world peace.

00:06:27.979 --> 00:06:29.105
Mi!

00:06:29.781 --> 00:06:30.679
Tsubasa!

00:06:37.356 --> 00:06:41.918
Tsubasa Amano also possesses
some rather good soma!

00:06:44.529 --> 00:06:45.630
Tsubasa!

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:50.135
This happened because I listened to Mr. Oh.

00:06:50.135 --> 00:06:52.501
Why didn't you talk to me first?

00:06:53.505 --> 00:06:57.305
Because I've always just relied on you.

00:06:58.810 --> 00:07:04.146
It's not good for a person to be unable
to walk on their own, is it?

00:07:11.189 --> 00:07:12.257
Tsubasa!

00:07:12.257 --> 00:07:15.560
I've been a burden on you this whole time.

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:18.397
You could do anything, but...

00:07:18.397 --> 00:07:21.332
As long as I'm around, you'll never be free.

00:07:21.933 --> 00:07:24.663
Is that why you've avoided me?

00:07:25.370 --> 00:07:27.167
I don't need freedom!

00:07:28.407 --> 00:07:32.244
I've always held your hand, felt your warmth.

00:07:32.244 --> 00:07:36.806
You're my sister! You're my love! You're mine!

00:07:37.916 --> 00:07:38.883
Mi...

00:07:39.551 --> 00:07:42.954
I love you so much I could go crazy!

00:07:42.954 --> 00:07:45.354
That's why I've acted so aloof.

00:07:45.891 --> 00:07:49.594
I was sorority leader to try to rein myself in.

00:07:49.594 --> 00:07:52.654
Otherwise, I think I may have lost it!

00:07:55.400 --> 00:07:56.367
Tsubasa!

00:07:56.802 --> 00:07:59.999
I can't be apart from you!

00:08:01.706 --> 00:08:03.037
Mi...

00:08:04.543 --> 00:08:05.610
Please...

00:08:05.610 --> 00:08:07.578
Destroy me!

00:08:09.581 --> 00:08:11.105
Tsubasa!

00:08:18.890 --> 00:08:19.686
Break!

00:08:21.993 --> 00:08:23.255
BREAK!

00:08:25.831 --> 00:08:29.601
Feminine guile is all that drives you.

00:08:29.601 --> 00:08:31.068
Such a grave sin!

00:08:31.503 --> 00:08:35.769
No! I can't bear to live or die without Tsubasa!

00:08:41.246 --> 00:08:42.270
Sasha.

00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:45.946
Mafuyu, I'm an idiot.

00:08:47.052 --> 00:08:50.155
My naivety is what caused this.

00:08:50.155 --> 00:08:52.487
I've made innocents pay with blood.

00:08:54.025 --> 00:08:55.617
It's not your fault.

00:08:56.027 --> 00:08:59.463
Do I have the right to drink your soma?

00:08:59.931 --> 00:09:02.900
What are you saying?
If you don't drink, you'll die!

00:09:03.301 --> 00:09:05.132
Dying is of no consequence.

00:09:06.338 --> 00:09:09.398
But laying bare your life's shame
takes a certain right.

00:09:12.844 --> 00:09:16.644
Life is harder than death
when no one wants you.

00:09:21.686 --> 00:09:24.621
I will pardon your life.

00:09:27.626 --> 00:09:29.617
I need you!

00:09:31.196 --> 00:09:32.424
I know.

00:09:33.164 --> 00:09:35.792
Mafuyu, please fight with me.

00:09:38.637 --> 00:09:42.835
Sasha. I don't know about God and all,

00:09:43.808 --> 00:09:46.174
but when it comes to receiving Athos's secrets...

00:09:48.146 --> 00:09:50.046
I grant you permission.

00:09:51.883 --> 00:09:52.679
Yeah.

00:10:10.201 --> 00:10:15.730
Why is your soma so sweet? So hot?

00:10:18.343 --> 00:10:21.176
On that day, I told you to wait.

00:10:21.846 --> 00:10:24.474
And yet, you came here.

00:10:25.350 --> 00:10:28.717
Yes. I want to fight by your side.

00:10:29.387 --> 00:10:32.049
I couldn't stand just to wait.

00:10:32.824 --> 00:10:34.883
I want to be your strength!

00:10:35.193 --> 00:10:36.217
Mafuyu.

00:10:37.262 --> 00:10:38.320
Sasha!

00:10:46.037 --> 00:10:49.734
By your death,
the divine punishment shall begin!

00:10:53.144 --> 00:10:54.079
He's alive!

00:10:54.079 --> 00:10:55.171
You're here?

00:10:57.882 --> 00:10:59.384
But how?

00:10:59.384 --> 00:11:02.114
I thought I told you: I will save her!

00:11:04.089 --> 00:11:09.755
"Save"? With your paltry body, feeble strength,
just what can you save?!

00:11:10.061 --> 00:11:12.393
I'll show you, puppet.

00:11:12.764 --> 00:11:14.332
Let's go, Mafuyu!

00:11:14.332 --> 00:11:15.356
Okay!

00:11:15.500 --> 00:11:17.627
I'll finish this. All of it!

00:11:18.803 --> 00:11:20.270
Circuit engage!

00:11:29.347 --> 00:11:32.043
If the Magdalene of Thunder
can control electronics,

00:11:33.151 --> 00:11:36.416
the Maria of the Blade rules
sword and severance!

00:11:37.455 --> 00:11:39.582
Forced dissolution of molecular bonds!

00:11:42.427 --> 00:11:47.999
Depending on the operation, it's capable
of cutting with nano-level precision!

00:11:47.999 --> 00:11:49.227
Impertinence!

00:11:50.702 --> 00:11:53.466
If you can manipulate cause
and effect through numerical values...

00:11:54.806 --> 00:11:58.009
we'll slice even through those
and get Tsubasa back!

00:11:58.009 --> 00:12:03.606
Bark all you like, but I can no longer
be felled by physical attacks!

00:12:09.487 --> 00:12:10.522
Sasha!

00:12:10.522 --> 00:12:15.186
You are a blot upon history!
Begone Deadly One, Sasha!

00:12:18.830 --> 00:12:20.127
What?!

00:12:20.598 --> 00:12:23.294
What's wrong? Move, Tsubasa!

00:12:24.235 --> 00:12:25.998
She still has hopes!

00:12:26.404 --> 00:12:30.534
People consumed by ambition
are destined to accomplish nothing.

00:12:31.376 --> 00:12:33.867
Bastard, you have far too much self-confidence!

00:12:35.413 --> 00:12:36.846
Damn you!

00:12:37.015 --> 00:12:37.879
Mafuyu.

00:12:39.751 --> 00:12:43.243
Tremble! Kneel in fear!

00:12:57.936 --> 00:13:01.303
It's no good. I can't find an exit anywhere.

00:13:01.606 --> 00:13:05.838
What a pain. We don't know
how things are outside, either.

00:13:06.444 --> 00:13:07.411
Miss Katja!

00:13:08.513 --> 00:13:12.210
My consciousness should
be connected to the witchcraft!

00:13:13.451 --> 00:13:16.249
Yes. That may be the fastest route.

00:13:17.388 --> 00:13:20.721
Ayame, use Hana and gain deep access.

00:13:21.025 --> 00:13:21.855
Deep!

00:13:22.227 --> 00:13:24.855
You want to go deep, not access the surface?

00:13:25.363 --> 00:13:29.197
If we can't get out, all we can do
is give word to the "landlord."

00:13:34.506 --> 00:13:38.243
This is the interior of witchcraft?
Can we even get in?

00:13:38.243 --> 00:13:40.545
You have to. Access it!

00:13:40.545 --> 00:13:41.637
Roger!

00:13:54.659 --> 00:13:54.993
Ow...

00:13:54.993 --> 00:13:56.394
Looks like you did it.
Ow...

00:13:56.394 --> 00:13:58.589
This is the computer's deepest level?

00:13:59.631 --> 00:14:00.689
Who're you?

00:14:01.566 --> 00:14:02.801
Tsubasa Amano?

00:14:02.801 --> 00:14:04.769
That's not for you to worry about.

00:14:06.571 --> 00:14:08.698
You're the Magdalene of Thunder, yes?

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.275
Hana?

00:14:10.275 --> 00:14:11.902
Hey. We came to help you.

00:14:12.277 --> 00:14:14.370
You'll... help me?

00:14:15.013 --> 00:14:15.847
Well...

00:14:15.847 --> 00:14:16.614
Huh?

00:14:16.614 --> 00:14:18.741
Sorry, but we're too late.

00:14:19.150 --> 00:14:25.657
Your mind and body have already been bound
here by the silicate user, unfortunately.

00:14:25.657 --> 00:14:26.715
No way!

00:14:28.993 --> 00:14:33.798
I see. But I'll get you all out of here somehow.

00:14:33.798 --> 00:14:35.891
Computers are my specialty.

00:14:37.802 --> 00:14:39.326
Don't just give up!

00:14:39.838 --> 00:14:40.896
Hana...

00:14:41.239 --> 00:14:43.969
Thank you. But it's fine.

00:14:44.776 --> 00:14:49.848
Mi will smash me, and that will be the end of it.

00:14:49.848 --> 00:14:51.816
It's not "fine"!

00:14:51.816 --> 00:14:53.977
How could I just abandon a classmate?!

00:14:56.321 --> 00:14:57.618
Thank you.

00:14:58.189 --> 00:15:03.328
Well. Hana, you've changed in the
short time I haven't seen you.

00:15:03.328 --> 00:15:05.023
Shall we give it a shot?

00:15:05.396 --> 00:15:07.091
There's something we can do, right?!

00:15:07.398 --> 00:15:10.424
You will inherit the Magdalene of Thunder.

00:15:10.702 --> 00:15:11.502
Huh?

00:15:11.502 --> 00:15:15.029
Then, you will show me absolute
control over it, as a Maria.

00:15:16.307 --> 00:15:21.210
I took a gradual approach to Mafuyu's training,
but I can't give you that kind of time.

00:15:21.479 --> 00:15:23.970
If you fail, everyone dies.

00:15:28.753 --> 00:15:32.657
Tsubasa, this is your last task
as the Magdalene of Thunder.

00:15:32.657 --> 00:15:34.425
Perform your calculations perfectly.

00:15:34.425 --> 00:15:36.160
Okay, I'll try.

00:15:36.160 --> 00:15:37.262
And me?!

00:15:37.262 --> 00:15:39.196
Give a yell and make it happen somehow.

00:15:41.766 --> 00:15:44.860
Inside the computer, we're just numerical data.

00:15:45.536 --> 00:15:49.996
If we can manipulate those calculations
perfectly, we should be able to pull it off.

00:15:51.676 --> 00:15:54.645
To think we'd be mimicking
the silicate user's methods...

00:15:55.013 --> 00:15:58.540
But the probability is 0.000000...

00:15:59.117 --> 00:16:02.245
Ayame. If we fail, the universe will disappear.

00:16:06.891 --> 00:16:08.085
Fuse with her...

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.557
Fuse with her...

00:16:26.911 --> 00:16:28.012
Mi!

00:16:28.012 --> 00:16:29.604
Tsubasa! How?

00:16:29.981 --> 00:16:32.347
Everyone helped me.

00:16:34.819 --> 00:16:37.413
I have inherited the Magdalene of Thunder.

00:16:37.755 --> 00:16:41.247
You may have Tsubasa,
but you'll have none of that power!

00:16:41.459 --> 00:16:45.589
Uploading one of Athos's Maria
was your downfall!

00:16:46.597 --> 00:16:48.189
Damn you!

00:16:51.803 --> 00:16:52.570
Hana!

00:16:52.570 --> 00:16:54.265
Okay. Logout!

00:17:13.658 --> 00:17:15.293
Boy!

00:17:15.293 --> 00:17:18.997
Escaping inside a computer
didn't lead you to paradise.

00:17:18.997 --> 00:17:21.766
Instead, you're going to hell.

00:17:21.766 --> 00:17:22.926
Fool child!

00:17:26.971 --> 00:17:29.269
Still you fail to grasp what's important.

00:17:30.475 --> 00:17:32.466
For the sake of a peace that must be...

00:17:33.311 --> 00:17:35.905
such sacrifices cannot be helped!

00:17:36.214 --> 00:17:38.978
No life is worth sacrificing!

00:17:39.317 --> 00:17:40.306
Impossible!

00:17:41.052 --> 00:17:42.076
It IS possible!

00:17:46.190 --> 00:17:47.657
You fool.

00:17:47.792 --> 00:17:51.523
You can do nothing with soma
taken from those unconscious women.

00:17:52.563 --> 00:17:56.234
I will show you TRUE soma!

00:17:56.234 --> 00:17:57.599
Miyuki, Tsubasa!

00:17:57.869 --> 00:17:59.268
I'm going to suck you.

00:17:59.504 --> 00:18:00.835
O-Okay.

00:18:01.239 --> 00:18:04.333
What do you know of truth, boy?!

00:18:16.254 --> 00:18:17.551
You did well.

00:18:18.089 --> 00:18:20.785
Mr. Sasha... Or just "Sasha"?

00:18:21.893 --> 00:18:23.227
Either is fine.

00:18:23.227 --> 00:18:25.991
Will of Iron!

00:18:32.437 --> 00:18:33.404
Sasha!

00:18:33.871 --> 00:18:37.671
If your feelings are those of love,
stay alive and prove it!

00:18:39.043 --> 00:18:42.206
Proof of love? Yes, you're right.

00:18:43.181 --> 00:18:47.709
A whelp like you has no right to speak of love!

00:18:49.087 --> 00:18:53.319
I do! So long as there's this warmth, this soma!

00:19:00.965 --> 00:19:05.561
But a heretic like you has no right
to speak of tomorrow!

00:19:07.305 --> 00:19:11.173
I do! Yes, I do! Make no mistake!

00:19:12.276 --> 00:19:13.937
Judgment!

00:19:16.581 --> 00:19:19.550
I alight to heaven.

00:19:30.561 --> 00:19:33.029
May the sinner find redemption.

00:19:42.406 --> 00:19:43.430
It's over, isn't it?

00:19:44.442 --> 00:19:45.431
Let's go home.

00:19:46.077 --> 00:19:47.135
Where to?

00:19:48.346 --> 00:19:49.540
Well...

00:20:00.091 --> 00:20:04.221
We never saw Sasha or the others after that.

00:20:04.929 --> 00:20:08.499
All enrollment data on them was deleted,

00:20:08.499 --> 00:20:13.835
with nothing remaining to prove they existed.

00:20:14.639 --> 00:20:19.338
And yet, the memories of them
remained within us...

00:20:19.877 --> 00:20:24.405
The story of a silver-haired prince
who saved our academy.

00:20:25.550 --> 00:20:26.608
Mi!

00:20:27.852 --> 00:20:30.388
I'm writing a book right now.

00:20:30.388 --> 00:20:32.490
Writing? Not reading one?

00:20:32.490 --> 00:20:33.354
Yup.

00:20:33.858 --> 00:20:36.827
It's the story of a prince who loves breasts.

00:20:37.128 --> 00:20:39.358
Uh, I don't know about that...

00:20:39.697 --> 00:20:40.898
It's bad?

00:20:40.898 --> 00:20:43.924
Not exactly bad. Show it to me sometime, okay?

00:20:44.835 --> 00:20:45.631
Yeah!

00:20:46.037 --> 00:20:48.505
I want you to read it first, Mi.

00:20:51.409 --> 00:20:52.410
Say, Tsubasa...

00:20:52.410 --> 00:20:55.504
Mi. Stop that talk right now.

00:20:57.248 --> 00:20:59.773
After all, we're alive.

00:21:06.991 --> 00:21:09.260
I'm fine with just one.

00:21:09.260 --> 00:21:14.789
So long as someone forgives me,
I can live for tomorrow.

00:21:17.401 --> 00:21:20.037
The rest of the dream lies in reality.

00:21:20.037 --> 00:21:24.371
And even in reality, the story continues.

00:21:26.577 --> 00:21:27.874
Forever and ever.

00:21:48.466 --> 00:21:54.905
Yuraida, hitaishou no kidou

00:21:54.905 --> 00:22:01.412
Jokyoku ni kazashita kousai

00:22:01.412 --> 00:22:07.652
Hikari no shuushisen wa hizunda mama

00:22:07.652 --> 00:22:13.249
Kashika sareta yume o kataru

00:22:15.126 --> 00:22:20.498
Yuuan na kyokou no shin'en ni

00:22:20.498 --> 00:22:26.604
Itsuka torawareta sekai o uchinuke

00:22:26.604 --> 00:22:28.572
Ah, break up the fake, stand in the truth

00:22:28.572 --> 00:22:30.241
And you will die in your sin

00:22:30.241 --> 00:22:33.444
Juuji o kire, fuzai no kami ni

00:22:33.444 --> 00:22:37.081
Kakusei no uta o kanadeshi koe wa

00:22:37.081 --> 00:22:39.917
Boutoku no tsurugi ka?

00:22:39.917 --> 00:22:41.485
Chain up the pain, stand up to sin

00:22:41.485 --> 00:22:43.154
Let no one lead you astray

00:22:43.154 --> 00:22:46.891
Shadan sareta kimi to no oratorio

00:22:46.891 --> 00:22:49.794
Aisetsu o tsuki ga terashite

00:22:49.794 --> 00:22:55.391
Aoku kagayaku asu e no eve

00:23:10.014 --> 00:23:11.048
Next Episode

00:23:11.048 --> 00:23:14.118
Ah, Tsubasa! I'm so glad you're okay.

00:23:14.118 --> 00:23:16.120
And you, Mi. Thank you.

00:23:16.120 --> 00:23:18.189
Tsubasa, I swear! You're so cute, cute, CUTE!

00:23:18.189 --> 00:23:20.758
No, don't pinch my cheeks!

00:23:20.758 --> 00:23:23.294
I'm going to keep going like this
and this, and lick and lick you!

00:23:23.294 --> 00:23:25.363
No, don't lick me!

00:23:25.363 --> 00:23:26.664
Hubba hubba!

00:23:26.664 --> 00:23:28.566
Next time on Qwaser of Stigmata II,

00:23:28.566 --> 00:23:31.235
Madam Lilly's Breast Fortune-telling

00:23:31.235 --> 00:23:34.038
Tremble! Kneel down in fear!

